# Per-run workspace artifacts.
# The pipeline writes each run into ./<slug>/ in the user's current directory; these
# patterns keep an accidental in-repo test run (and its run-ledger) out of git.
.run-state.json
RUN-LOG.md
**/01-diagnostics/
**/02-enrichment/
**/03-think-tanks/
**/report/
**/.codex-out/

# Python bytecode (the codex/ driver is stdlib Python — never stage its caches).
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS / editor cruft
.DS_Store
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/
